at did you consider before making the purchase?<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Initially launched in 2007, Facebook Marketplace was relaunched in October 2016. The second-hand peer-to-peer market is yet another industry Facebook is trying to enter. It is directly competing with existing online retailers such as Craigslist and eBay. Facebook Marketplace has a couple pros and cons relative to the current competitors. Where does Marketplace have the [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[4],"tags":[329,169,161,170,240,14,241],"class_list":["post-1688","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-brand-blog","tag-craigslist","tag-facebook","tag-market-share","tag-messenger","tag-network-effects","tag-trust","tag-two-sided-networks","entry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v22.7 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Facebook Marketplace: Will it Survive? - Brand Blog - Iva Boishin<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.ibafflatusdesign.space\/brand-blog\/facebook-marketplace-will-survive\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Facebook Marketplace: Will it Survive? - Brand Blog - Iva Boishin\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Initially launched in 2007, Facebook Marketplace was relaunched in October 2016. The second-hand peer-to-peer market is yet another industry Facebook is trying to enter. It is directly competing with existing online retailers such as Craigslist and eBay. Facebook Marketplace has a couple pros and cons relative to the current compe